    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Mechanical per-placeholder: decide substitution strategy (skill-side substitution block extension / runtime derivation from az context / hardcoded Spaarke constant / defer to post-intake scope) + implement + verify. Substitution-block extension in skill Step 0.5b is a well-scoped edit.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <effort-reason>31 placeholder tokens across 19 prereqs. Each needs strategy decision. Plus a scope-placement decision for PRQ-E-13 (declared once_per_env but references {customerId} only known post-intake — either move to once_per_customer scope OR extend skill to run some prereqs post-intake). Also fix PRQ-E-07 unescaped `$filter` bash-expansion.</effort-reason>
